{
  "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang",
  "chapter": 1,
  "act": 1,
  "scene": "zhaoyang",
  "palette": "gold",
  "cast": [
    "wuze",
    "shenheng",
    "tangjian"
  ],
  "require": {
    "flag.petition_sent": true
  },
  "weightless": false,
  "leavesLetter": [],
  "purpose": "补件不能抹去原牒，首次核问已经沿细节指向阿荻",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l1",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_chase_first": true
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你跑上石阶，鞋里都是水，袖子贴着仍在发酸的手臂。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l2",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_chase_first": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "原牒要补一句，那个例证未经当事人允可，请先收下，别让后面的抄件漏掉。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l3",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_chase_first": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "原件已经入署，补件赶上了后抄的这一份，我能添上，不能替你抽走原件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l4",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_chase_first": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "阿荻知道里面写了多少？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l5",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_chase_first": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "只念了例证。我让宋才人陪着，先来追。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l6",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_chase_first": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "她来不及问的还在那里等，你把副本带回去，一条一条说给她听，不能只报追过了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l7",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_explain_first": true
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你跨过积水，袖中留着阿荻要你照录的两句话，没有替她润色。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l8",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_explain_first": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "她已听完抄件，准我补这两句：旧衣确是她送，私话未许我作呈文。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l9",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_explain_first": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这两句照补，原牒却已另抄出一份；后送的更正得再走一程，不能当它没出去。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l10",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_explain_first": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "她还说什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l11",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_explain_first": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "后面的话，要等她自己来讲。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l12",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_explain_first": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那就停在这里，她准你带来多少便写多少，预备好的话也不能替她添满。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l13",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "阶下，那匹缺了一点耳尖的马正在等回厩，鼻息吹动了颈边的湿鬃。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l14",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "它听见空桶挪动，又偏了一下头；没有因为昨日停过试就不再怕响。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l15",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你下意识想去碰它，唐简手中的回牒却已经展开。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l16",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "回来了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l17",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "叫我何时来？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l18",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "没先叫你。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l19",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "沈衡移开挡光的手。那一行字完整地露出来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l20",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "初八西库旧衣十一件，先问当日交纳经手人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l21",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "可提出人写的是我。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l22",
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "提出人是你，经手人是她，回牒沿你留下的那几样东西，已经能找过去。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l23",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你按住湿透的袖口，那里还留着阿荻替你改的针脚。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l24",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "把我未经同意便引用的事也记下，别到她开口的时候，又只剩那一行旧欠。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l25",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "已记。送递的先后也留着。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l26",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "她在补件旁添下时刻，另取一份，不去抹原牒。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l27",
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "传问已经往掖庭去了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l28",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "马蹄在阶下挪了一步，你却望向来时那道门。"
    }
  ],
  "chapterEnd": true,
  "goto": "ch02_s01_yeting"
}
